<title>NEW ZEALAND: PFI reports NZ$2.1 mln nine month profit.</title>
<headline>PFI reports NZ$2.1 mln nine month profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   2.1 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Div					    nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				     6.6 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				2.7 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Tax					    0.6 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  76.4 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - Property for Industry Ltd is a property investor. The company said it made a $4.1 million tax paid surplus for the period if a $1.9 million unrealised loss on its property portfolio, reported in its half year result, is excluded.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
